flowchart TD
    Q["Ticket: 'Content Patch' requested"] --> G["Grep repo & PR titles<br/>for 'content patch'"]
    G --> H{Hit found?}
    H -->|No| D["Inspect tell-tale directories"]
    H -->|Yes| P["Inspect file diffs of<br/>recent 'content patch' PRs"]
    D --> P
    P --> E{What file types changed?}
    E -->|".sql / seeds / migrations"| C["Option C:<br/>DB seed / prompt-table update"]
    E -->|".md / .yaml / .json<br/>in content or prompts dir"| A["Option A:<br/>Backend content update<br/>(file-based)"]
    E -->|".tsx / .jsx / locale files"| B["Option B:<br/>Frontend copy change"]
    C --> X["Route to: Backend / Data eng<br/>Ship via seed script or admin UI"]
    A --> Y["Route to: Backend eng<br/>Ship via PR, no logic review needed"]
    B --> Z["Route to: Frontend eng<br/>Ship via PR + visual QA"]
    X --> F["Codify definition in<br/>CONTRIBUTING.md / glossary"]
    Y --> F
    Z --> F
